  "content": "<h2><strong>在 Forge 47.1.4+ 版本中失效，请使用 47.1.3 或更低版本</strong></h2><p>一款增加抓钩的模组。本模组的宗旨是提供一种有趣的方式，以便在大型建筑（如城市）中移动。</p><p>此模组仅适用于 Forge。非官方的 Fabric/Quilt 移植版正在开发中 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grappling-hook-restitched\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a></p><p>1.16.5/1.18.2/1.19.2 版本需要 Cloth Config API： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config-forge</a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em>特别感谢 Nyfaria (<a href=\"https://github.com/Nyfaria\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Nyfaria</a>) 对 1.19 和 1.18 版本的更新，以及 Mayesnake (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mayesnake/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/mayesnake/projects</a>) 提供的新纹理！</em></strong></span></p><h2>V13 版本：</h2><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uVs3eeybqc8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DB1IAGU.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h4>更新日志：</h4><p>- 由 <em><strong>Mayesnake (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grappling-hook-mod/settings/link\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/mayesnake/projects</a>)</strong></em> 制作的新纹理<br>- 带有物理效果的 3D 钩子<br>- 细微的视觉改进<br>- 错误修复</p><h2>V12 版本：</h2><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Gxgf5r8JmXc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aWRu7kl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"260\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Sss11Lg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"478\" height=\"262\"></p><h4>v12 更新日志：</h4><p>- 1.16.5 移植版</p><p>- 1.18.2 移植版由 <em><strong>Nyfaria (<a href=\"https://github.com/Nyfaria\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Nyfaria</a>)</strong></em> 完成</p><p>- 靴子的新附魔<br>- 墙面奔跑<br>- 滑行<br>- 二段跳<br>- 抓钩修饰器中的更多选项：<br>- “火箭”升级（将用户向前推进，燃料自动再生）<br>- 添加“粘性绳索”选项<br>- 添加了一些音效<br>- 允许更改按键绑定<br>- 更多的配置选项<br>- 允许制作某些预设的抓钩<br>- 分别控制双抓钩的按键绑定<br>- 更多的错误修复（非常感谢 Shivaxi 进行了大量测试！）</p><h2> </h2><h2>更多动图</h2><div class=\"spoiler\"><h2>v11 新增内容：</h2><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UEPvewA.gif\"></p><p>新的绳索物理效果<img src=\"https://imgur.com/IbILo73.gif\"></p><p>新的自定义系统<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZRU8a6F.png\"></p><p>自定义系统图形界面</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yeSXbHq.png\"></p><p>新的配置文件以调整游戏平衡性</p><p>请注意，在此版本中，由于自定义系统的引入，配方和其他内容已更改，因此这应该可以缓解关于模组过于超额的担忧。</p><h2>v10 新增内容：<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/rpYs4di.gif\"></h2><p>智能机动抓钩 - 基于《泰坦陨落2》中的抓钩</p><p>(地图： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252ffuture-city-3149015\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.planetminecraft.com/project/future-city-3149015</a>)</p><p>(完整视频： )<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fu1VawAqziQ0\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/u1VawAqziQ0</a></p><h2>v7 新增内容：<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/zxMBJ2v.gif\"></h2><p>磁性抓钩 - 像蜘蛛侠一样荡秋千！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252ffuture-city-3149015%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(地图： </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252ffuture-city-3149015\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.planetminecraft.com/project/future-city-3149015</a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252ffuture-city-3149015%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">)</a></p><p> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/RIRLQ7c.gif\"></p><p>双机动抓钩 - 在建筑物间穿梭！</p><p>(地图： )<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fproject-shiganshina-district-attach-on-titan\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.planetminecraft.com/project/project-shiganshina-district-attach-on-titan</a></p></div><h3>视频</h3><p>观看所有演示视频： <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLf9KesthqnFnuCS-FKlQSlqqRGKYmeHBk\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLf9KesthqnFnuCS-FKlQSlqqRGKYmeHBk</a></p><h2>评论与教程</h2><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Bj0N-5B81mM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/i9NdOLo2_wE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HRhTV1b0nA4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7PONrbAcYQI?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1tglWWQunQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/89MIGs7UFkE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/917r2ptxugM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p></div><h2>旧纹理</h2><p>旧纹理的材质包： <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/16VX65DvZNiLwJCutQUeUKnsOUZ38BAAg/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/16VX65DvZNiLwJCutQUeUKnsOUZ38BAAg/view?usp=sharing</a></p><h2>配置</h2><p>模组选项中包含游戏内配置，或者您可以编辑配置文件 grapplingHook.cfg</p><p>此外，您可能想查看此模组： <a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/1286235-custom-recipes-make-customize-and-remove-crafting\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/1286235-custom-recipes-make-customize-and-remove-crafting</a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 或类似的模组来配置合成配方或删除物品</a></p><h2>源代码</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/yyon/grapplemod\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/yyon/grapplemod</a></p><p>视频中显示的地图（非本人制作）： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252ffuture-city-3149015\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.planetminecraft.com/project/future-city-3149015</a></p><p>还有 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fproject-shiganshina-district-attach-on-titan\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.planetminecraft.com/project/project-shiganshina-district-attach-on-titan</a></p><p>以及 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fru-titanfall-2-uma\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/project/ru-titanfall-2-uma</a></p>",
